            "detailed_description": "Thundering Skies is a shoot'em up inspired by the 16-bit classics of the genre. Making an appearance are the obligatory fire and ice-themed levels, giant battleships, scratchy voice samples, huge bosses and overpowered weapons that make you feel naked when you lose them - as well some less expected features.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncludes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 6 stages<br />\r\n- 2 game modes: autosave your progress or beat it in one sit with limited credits for an extra score boost<br />\r\n- 4 difficulty levels, including an introductory mode<br />\r\n- 10 Steam Achievements<br />\r\n- Challenging bosses and minibosses<br />\r\n- Online score board<br />\r\n- An amazing soundtrack by Bettina Calmon<br />\r\n- Adjustable scanlines for that lovely CRT effect",
            "about_the_game": "Thundering Skies is a shoot'em up inspired by the 16-bit classics of the genre. Making an appearance are the obligatory fire and ice-themed levels, giant battleships, scratchy voice samples, huge bosses and overpowered weapons that make you feel naked when you lose them - as well some less expected features.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncludes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 6 stages<br />\r\n- 2 game modes: autosave your progress or beat it in one sit with limited credits for an extra score boost<br />\r\n- 4 difficulty levels, including an introductory mode<br />\r\n- 10 Steam Achievements<br />\r\n- Challenging bosses and minibosses<br />\r\n- Online score board<br />\r\n- An amazing soundtrack by Bettina Calmon<br />\r\n- Adjustable scanlines for that lovely CRT effect",
